msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It was you who disappeared..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……君が消えた……。"

#: search:search_3F44A27A_5E4B_498F_81C9_43A353E7CFEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: afb0648b2a0c4951e631573c67e6cbdcbec3264cb3bf99f4100303bf031f3bb2
#. default-sha256: a428c2db7a391e62688e39e24aa53de724713fe19a3646aaa24b83de69ee8268
msgctxt "search:search_3F44A27A_5E4B_498F_81C9_43A353E7CFEB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh my... ⟪k:3⟫It was ⟪k:4⟫I⟪k:5⟫ who disappeared?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫That is quite strange. "
"I did not go anywhere, as far as I am aware."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫あら……、⟪k:3⟫居なくなったのはわたくしの方ですって？⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫おかしいですわね、"
"⟪k:6⟫そんなことはないと思うのですけれども。"

#: search:search_E2712B82_695C_4D54_A63F_254D4F55FE9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 444475775abe177d43beec7ed96b0e5655a152c9c13c2c4888f6d6ac59b1ce7d
#. default-sha256: a945abd2eaddffe628f581f98a5ce93097e3d0694996ad9e1adc3cb38306a320
msgctxt "search:search_E2712B82_695C_4D54_A63F_254D4F55FE9C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nevertheless, I am glad to have found you.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I would have been at a complete "
"loss for what to do⟪k:4⟫if I had been separated from you yet again."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫でも、⟪k:2⟫お姿が見えてなによりです。⟪k:3⟫また離ればなれになってしまったら、⟪k:4⟫わたく"
"し、⟪k:5⟫どうしたら良いのか……。"

