msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I did, indeed, say that when you first arrived.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I have been waiting for "
"your return for a very long time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ええ、⟪k:3⟫最初に申し上げました通り、⟪k:4⟫わたくしはずっとあなた様をお待ちしていた"
"のです。⟪k:5⟫本当に長い間……。"

#: search:search_140202FB_9473_4BAF_BFD0_E32CA5DCC3E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4806b13508441f7c973b42feef1942a306fe6f6e695849c03f6601ddee0027dd
