#: search:search_E72785FD_5854_43DD_B8DA_45D0F2A1512F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14a5cc69982e3fdbca258bfa32ea9d788390261f3df7a11a5792bbb46774383d
