msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe... ⟪k:3⟫I am very much not a ghost.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Would I be able to hold your "
"hand if I were?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫うふふ……。⟪k:3⟫そんなことはありませんよ。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫幽霊なら、⟪k:6⟫手は握れないで"
"しょう？"

#: search:search_7860D620_E190_48D4_80A9_0805BEAEAB0E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0a2e0945c4664e93149760f482b8151df06356f202d0b02abd56b10fd3e699f
#. default-sha256: 12924eea24592c70a8616b9af25c916035d9a9ae3e60ee5a7b291e7e88e63794
msgctxt "search:search_7860D620_E190_48D4_80A9_0805BEAEAB0E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Saying this, the Maid took ⟪k:1⟫Your⟪k:2⟫the Departed’s⟪k:3⟫ hand.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It was cold "
"enough to send a shudder down ⟪k:6⟫Your⟪k:7⟫his⟪k:8⟫ spine—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫and completely devoid "
"of life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫女中はそう言うと、⟪k:1⟫再び「⟪k:2⟫あなた⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫死者⟪k:5⟫」の手を取った。⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫やはり"
"ぞっとするほど冷たく、⟪k:8⟫生気をまったく感じさせない。"

#: search:search_878F0081_8437_4841_BF7E_8563EAA5D849
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20c33ee327979bffe5ef7c821c1537471919447151ad5c0798a213cba026e456
