msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫（触れられるんじゃないのか……）"

#: search:search_BE70A293_14BB_44D3_B717_34A0A7CB01F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e413e72cdeead10a4a0ccf57e6b508b2e939b4c2bfc543516d021f736b24b4c
